{"id":"n24237-1-5","stage":4,"title":"눈높이 · 眼睛高度","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n24237-1-5-1","ko":"이 액자는 어디에 걸까?","zh":"这个相框应该挂在哪儿呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이：这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27527","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"액자는","meaning":"相框，镜框，画框","explanation":"액자：相框，镜框，画框；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"액자","audio":"/audio/ded7183e732eecbd4535.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66734","senseId":"1","lemma":"액자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어디에","meaning":"哪里，哪儿","explanation":"어디：哪里，哪儿；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60319","senseId":"1","lemma":"어디","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"걸까?","meaning":"挂","explanation":"걸다：挂；ㄹ까：非敬语地提出建议、自问或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"걸다","audio":"/audio/a44925f8d8720a550d7d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65528","senseId":"1","lemma":"걸다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"27527","definition":"指代离说话人较近的，或说话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"ded7183e732eecbd","term":"액자","zh":"相框，镜框，画框","audio":"/audio/ded7183e732eecbd4535.mp3","entryId":"66734","definition":"装字画、照片等的框架。","pronunciation":["액짜"]},{"id":"c1ee1b7e560f9f3a","term":"어디","zh":"哪里，哪儿","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3","entryId":"60319","definition":"指代不知道的处所。","pronunciation":["어디"]},{"id":"a44925f8d8720a55","term":"걸다","zh":"挂","audio":"/audio/a44925f8d8720a550d7d.mp3","entryId":"65528","definition":"为了使物体不掉落，吊挂在某处。","pronunciation":["걸ː다"]}],"audio":"/audio/924775de434a90f24199.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n24237-1-5-2","ko":"사람들 눈높이쯤에 걸면 눈에 잘 띌 거야.","zh":"挂在和人们视线差不多高的地方，就会很容易被看到。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"사람들","meaning":"人们，大家","explanation":"사람：人们，大家；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。","readings":[{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58161","senseId":"8","lemma":"사람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"눈높이쯤에","meaning":"眼睛高度","explanation":"눈높이：眼睛高度；쯤：名词后缀，构成派生名词。；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"눈높이","audio":"/audio/625d8a8721675b3045ea.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24237","senseId":"1","lemma":"눈높이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"걸면","meaning":"挂","explanation":"걸다：挂；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"걸다","audio":"/audio/a44925f8d8720a550d7d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65528","senseId":"1","lemma":"걸다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"눈에","meaning":"视线，眼光，看法","explanation":"눈：视线，眼光，看法；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"눈","audio":"/audio/ab1b14816087979d2143.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72704","senseId":"5","lemma":"눈","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"잘","meaning":"很好地，了不起地","explanation":"잘：很好地，了不起地","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"8","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"띌","meaning":"进入视线、被看见（눈에 띄다）","explanation":"띄다：进入视线、被看见（눈에 띄다）；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"띄다","audio":"/audio/40a0dc104ee774d011f5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14468","senseId":"1","lemma":"띄다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"거야.","meaning":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","explanation":"거：表示说话人的推测或信念等。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"5","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"389e7564ae2551b4","term":"사람","zh":"人们，大家","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3","entryId":"58161","definition":"对没有特别指定的，自己以外的人的称呼。","pronunciation":["사ː람"]},{"id":"625d8a8721675b30","term":"눈높이","zh":"眼睛高度","audio":"/audio/625d8a8721675b3045ea.mp3","entryId":"24237","definition":"指人在站立时，到眼睛的高度。","pronunciation":["눈노피"]},{"id":"a44925f8d8720a55","term":"걸다","zh":"挂","audio":"/audio/a44925f8d8720a550d7d.mp3","entryId":"65528","definition":"为了使物体不掉落，吊挂在某处。","pronunciation":["걸ː다"]},{"id":"ab1b14816087979d","term":"눈","zh":"视线，眼光，看法","audio":"/audio/ab1b14816087979d2143.mp3","entryId":"72704","definition":"人们的目光所指向的路线或方向。","pronunciation":["눈"]},{"id":"8aff11a4aebdccdb","term":"잘","zh":"很好地，了不起地","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3","entryId":"58939","definition":"非常好地、优秀地，值得称赞地。","pronunciation":["잘"]},{"id":"40a0dc104ee774d0","term":"띄다","zh":"进入视线、被看见（눈에 띄다）","audio":"/audio/40a0dc104ee774d011f5.mp3","entryId":"14468","definition":"进入视线、被看见（눈에 띄다）","pronunciation":["띠ː다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/8713eb6d828653a48c1f.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.9,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=24237","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":139,"sequenceScore":2.7267,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["挂在和人们视线差不多高的地方，就会很容易被看到。","这个相框应该挂在哪儿呢？","啊，可能是吃太多了，肚子胀得厉害。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["这个相框应该挂在哪儿呢？","啊，可能是吃太多了，肚子胀得厉害。","挂在和人们视线差不多高的地方，就会很容易被看到。"],"answer":2}]}
